direction: up

classes: {
  connection: {
    style.font-size: 20
  }
}

title: {
  label: Off detector equipments
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 40
}

# Nodes
PPr blade: {
  shape: class
  rack_number: integer
  shelf_number: integer
  slot_number: integer
  installation_date: timestamp
  modules: undefined
  tooltip: Validate what these modules are
}

Carrierboard: {
  shape: class
}
CPM: {
  shape: class
}
TDAQi: {
  shape: class
}
TileCoM: {
  shape: class
}
GbE switch: {
  shape: class
}
IPMC: {
  shape: class
}

# Edges
PPr blade -> TDAQi: up to 1 {class: connection}
CPM -> Carrierboard: up to 4 {class: connection}
IPMC -> Carrierboard: up to 1 {class: connection}
TileCoM -> Carrierboard: up to 1 {class: connection}
GbE switch-> Carrierboard: up to 1 {class: connection}
